<title>PHILIPPINES: Philippine peso unchanged in narrow trade.</title>
<headline>Philippine peso unchanged in narrow trade.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1996-10-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>--------------------------- Oct 21 -------------------------</p>
<p>* Peso average at 26.274 from 26.275</p>
<p>------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>The Philippiine peso ended steady at 26.273 pesos to the dollar in narrow trade on Monday, traders said.</p>
<p>&quot;There were not much inflows or outflows. It was a super boring day,&quot; said a foreign bank dealer.</p>
<p>A requirement for $27 million from oil importers failed to perk up the market. &quot;It was easily satisfied because the market is long in dollars,&quot; another trader said.</p>
</text>
